[version]
1.3.2
[date]
2026-10-21
[whatsnew]
- New: install-to-disk command - create bootable ArchOS-CC install disk
  * Copies entire system to floppy disk
  * Disk boots on any Advanced Computer with Disk Drive
  * Install menu: Install to local / Run from disk / CraftOS shell
  * Supports --list to see drives, <side> argument to skip prompt
- New: update backup subcommand - manual system backup
  * 'update backup' asks where to back up
  * 'update backup disk' goes directly to floppy disk
- update install now offers backup to floppy disk option
  * Detects disk drives automatically
  * Useful when local disk is full
- help command updated with all new disk/backup commands
[/whatsnew]
[files]
bin/install-to-disk.lua
bin/update.lua
bin/help.lua
installer.lua
latest_update.upd
[/files]
